# Testing

- Tests sit next to the code as `*.test.ts(x)`. Write the failing test first.
- API: build a fresh app in each test with `createTestApp()` from `apps/api/src/test/test-app.ts` and call it with `getJson(app, path)` or `app.request(path, init)`. Parse bodies with the shared zod schemas.
- The seed is deterministic (`TEST_REFERENCE_DATE`), so assert exact ids: Checkout has 30 tickets, `CHK-130` is first on page 1, and 4 are blocked.
- Every new project-scoped route gets two access tests: `internal-tools` (hidden) and an unknown id both return the same 404 body.
- Web: React Testing Library, query by role, label or text. No snapshots.
- e2e: one smoke test in `e2e/smoke.spec.ts`; add a step only for flows that cross API and UI.
- Run one file with `npx vitest run <path>`, everything with `npm test`, and `npm run check` before handing off.
